{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Outcome\nA written, testable stability contract for the CLI grammar, the SDK API, the storage format, and the published scale targets.\n\n## Gate semantics\nThis milestone is a gate, not a workstream: it cannot open until the grammar, SDK-complete, and provable-history milestones are reached, and its scale claims are limited to what the scale milestone has actually measured.\n\n## Delivery chain\nADR pm-agou drafts the contract -> pm-0mox alias usage counters supply removal evidence -> the cross-version compatibility matrix supplies format evidence -> benchmark evidence supplies the scale numbers.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNot a feature freeze. Not a marketing event — messaging lives under pm-wjfa."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-xp1xsw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Outcome milestone: v1.0 GA stability contract — frozen grammar, semver SDK surface, storage format policy, published scale targets"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Milestone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["contract","ga","horizon:gate","milestone","outcome","semver","stability"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2027-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":3600},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The CLI grammar is frozen against the contract table with alias-removal windows measured by usage counters, not guesswork; The public SDK surface carries semver commitments with a compatibility test suite proving them; Storage format_version policy defines forward and backward compatibility windows with an automated cross-version matrix; Published scale targets are backed by reproducible benchmark evidence, not claims"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"v1-ga-stability"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Downstream users can depend on pm surfaces with written, testable compatibility guarantees"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Without a stability contract every consumer treats pm as pre-release and refuses to build durable integrations on it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Converts the ecosystem from experimental packages to dependable ones and makes deprecations governable instead of ad hoc."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"A published contract states what is frozen, what may change, and how long removed spellings survive — enforced by compatibility tests."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Deferred deliberately: freezing before grammar consolidation and SDK completion would immortalise the surface this roadmap is trying to simplify."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-0mox","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-9rgaal","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-agou","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-j82fd3","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-m08hza","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-m2u1","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"},{"id":"pm-w7ccmv","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:44:20.858Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fe